    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2018_0513","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ếlodie Vasquez talks about silence, in three coats of varnish. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
